Subject: [PATCH] feat: add DrugFlow pocket-conditioned molecule generation
 tool

Add the `drugflow` toolkit to the `molecular_generation` category, wrapping
DrugFlow (LPDI-EPFL; flow matching + discrete Markov bridges for structure-based
drug design) as the `drugflow-generate` tool: Input/Config/Output/Metrics,
standalone env (clones the upstream repo and shells out to src/generate.py;
auto-downloads the public Zenodo checkpoints, so no training or manual weight
provisioning is required), README/cite.bib/license.yaml(MIT)/links.yaml, example
notebook, tests (incl. a device-agnostic benchmark), and the full export chain.
Also add the Modal deployment (service + manifest wiring + regenerated tool_map)
and list the category/toolkit in the README catalog.

