+# DrugFlow deployment
+
+Modal deployment for the [`drugflow` toolkit](../../../tools/molecular_generation/drugflow/README.md)
+(`drugflow-generate`).
+
+## Checkpoints
+
+DrugFlow's checkpoints are public (Zenodo record 14919171) and are downloaded into the Modal
+weights volume (`PROTO_MODEL_CACHE`, mounted at `/weights`) when the standalone environment is
+built on the first request — no manual provisioning is required. The build-time warmup only bakes
+the tool source into the image.
+
+## Benchmarks
+
+_Not yet recorded. Deployment benchmark tables here are generated by
+`pytest --benchmark --use-modal` once the service has been deployed._
